Iy8mi1BndzDyQgGlJIUAFDA" style=3D"color: #0077B6;">Today=E2=80=99s better-t=
han-forecast UK growth report</a> is good news for chancellor John Healey a=
s he hobnobs with other finance ministers at the IMF meeting in Bangkok. Bu=
t it may encourage the Bank of England to raise interest rates as soon as i=
ts next meeting in November.<strong><br><br></strong></p>
